# ds41-release-bf16trunk.recipe (w212): DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 official release, routed experts kept as the release's MXFP4
# (no rule), everything else the plugin declares bf16 -> cast dtype=bf16 (fp8 e4m3 * e8m0 block scale widening); norms / hc / router f32 as in
# bakon's deepseek41-ud-iq1s.recipe, from which this is derived (every ggml rule on a non-expert weight became cast bf16).
